# API

- The contract in `docs/api.md` is locked. Changing it = update doc + shared types + web client in one PR.
- Every endpoint: authn (except public L1/L2 read + L2 submit), authz by role, request validation,
  rate limit, request id, structured error `{error: {code, message, request_id}}`.
- Long-running work (L2 graph generation) is async: return a job id, poll or webhook.
- Feature flags gate demo-critical AI features (`FF_*` in `.env.example`).
- Health: `/health` (liveness) and `/ready` (DB, graph DB, Redis, LLM gateway reachable).
- Never return raw model output to the client; return the validated schema object.
